  "prefLabel": "Jus 1601.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Jus 1601.02 Scope. Controlled and non-controlled pharmaceutical drugs collected in accordance with this chapter shall be exempt from the disposal requirements for controlled drugs stipulated in RSA 318-B:17.\n\nSource. #10177, eff 8-23-12; ss by #13551, eff 2-2-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/jus1600.html"
